WEBVTT

00:01.840 --> 00:06.160
The will was sent back to the capital wang Ming was ordered to assist in governance.

00:06.240 --> 00:11.680
Crown Prince Sikong Sheng successfully ascended the throne and changed the era name to Taian the following year.

00:11.760 --> 00:16.120
Posthumously titled the late Emperor Sikong Yao as Wu historically known as Emperor Xuanwu.

00:16.960 --> 00:20.000
The second year of Taian Sikong Sheng moved the capital to Yong'an.

00:20.160 --> 00:25.040
Fulfilled the long-cherished wish to return to the old capital the same year.

00:25.120 --> 00:30.640
Sikong Sheng enfeoffed Sikong Xu as Prince of Yan giving him the responsibility to expand territory.

00:30.720 --> 00:36.480
While he himself governed the court focusing on governance Sikong Sheng once joked.

00:36.800 --> 00:41.120
War by the Prince of Yan, governance by me the two worked together.

00:41.280 --> 00:44.720
Becoming a timeless tale.

00:48.160 --> 00:49.560
Come, Yu'er.

00:54.800 --> 00:56.200
Your Majesty, coming, coming.

00:58.280 --> 00:59.880
Your Majesty.

01:01.480 --> 01:06.320
Your Majesty, your younger brother has not failed the mission you rascal.

01:06.560 --> 01:11.173
These years Xunyang has been in Yan Dong second brother was afraid they'd bully you.

01:12.160 --> 01:17.107
Fortunately, Murong of Yan Dong knows his place these years he's been respectfully serving little sister.

01:17.520 --> 01:20.880
Your Majesty said to find an opportunity to put him in his place.

01:20.960 --> 01:25.760
Your younger brother, it's hard to hit a smiling face alright, let's go.

01:25.920 --> 01:31.280
Rare reunion first tell Father that we've brought Xunyang back let's go.

01:33.000 --> 01:50.000
Yet surrounding the many enigmas of his early ascension, unofficial histories among the populace remained rife with contradictory accounts.

01:52.760 --> 01:58.240
During Sikong Sheng's reign Xuan Kingdom reached its peak all lands submitted.

01:58.400 --> 02:02.840
Received tribute from all nations border peoples requested to join.

02:03.440 --> 02:08.960
Honoring Sikong Sheng as Heavenly King historically known as the Taian Golden Age.

